x_comment(x_DeadPhysicalRemainsFn,"A unary #$CollectionDenotingFunction that takes a specialization of #$BiologicalLivingObject <code>BLO-TYPE</code> to the collection of all instances of #$OrganicMaterial that are the dead physical remains of an instance of <code>BLO-TYPE</code>.  For example, (#$DeadPhysicalRemainsFn #$Hamster) is the collection of all hamster corpses, i.e. hamster bodies (still recognizable as such) that are no longer alive.  Once a dead hamster's body has decayed to the point where it is no longer recognizable as a hamster's body, it is no longer an instance of (#$DeadPhysicalRemainsFn #$Hamster).\n<p>\nSee also the corresponding predicate #$deadPhysicalRemains and its instance level correlate #$deadPhysicalRemainsOf.") :- x_cid(a65b126f7c7c37).
xc_microtheory(a65b126f7c7c37,x_BiologyMt).
